        "image_ratio": "1 / 1",
        "image_ratio_wide": "21 / 9",
        "image_share": 44,
        "image_loading": "lazy",
        "eyebrow": "About us",
        "heading": "Two friends, one old wallpaper.",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "heading_size": 36,
        "text": "<p>We grew up on a blue taskbar and a green hill. Hilltop Supply is the clothes we wanted to wear about it: soft, a little funny, and made well enough to keep.</p><p>Every print is drawn by us and printed to order by a small studio, so nothing sits in a warehouse and nothing is thrown away.</p>",
        "center": false,
        "button_label": "Read our story",
        "button_link": "/pages/about",
        "button_style": "plain",
        "button2_label": "",
        "button2_link": "",
